    "message": "Implement factorized PNR sampling and stable direct clicks\n\nSample integer PNRs with a compact factor plan: 37.38-fold setup-inclusive speedup at 144 outputs with unchanged eight-port TV. Repair direct B8/16/32 on three fixed Jiuzhang subsystems; pair every speed claim with quantitative same-input accuracy.\n\nPreserve Frugal wins and explicit rare B128 normalization failures. Full hardware throughput and full-distribution superiority remain unproved.\n\nValidation: 3370 independent checks; 968 tests run, 939 passed, zero failures/errors; sixteen new tests.",
